
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Decor | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  description="Home decorating inspiration, timeless interiors, colour, furniture, and beautiful ideas for everyday living."
  heroTitle="Home Decor"
  heroText="Create a home that feels welcoming, thoughtful, and beautifully your own."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="decor-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Home & Interior Living</p>
    <h1>Creating a Beautiful Home</h1>
    <p>
      Discover inspiration for creating comfortable, elegant, and inviting
      interiors. From timeless decorating styles and thoughtful colour
      palettes to furniture, lighting, textiles, and the finishing touches,
      explore ideas that make a house feel like home.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="decor-grid">

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">01</div>
      <h2>Interior Decorating</h2>
      <p>
        Explore decorating styles, room layouts, beautiful details, and
        practical ideas for creating a home with character and personality.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">02</div>
      <h2>Colour & Paint</h2>
      <p>
        Discover harmonious colour combinations, timeless neutrals,
        accent colours, and ways to use paint to transform a room.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">03</div>
      <h2>Furniture & Accessories</h2>
      <p>
        Find inspiration for selecting furniture, mirrors, artwork,
        decorative objects, and the pieces that bring a room together.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">04</div>
      <h2>Lighting & Atmosphere</h2>
      <p>
        Learn how chandeliers, table lamps, wall lights, and natural
        lighting can create warmth and atmosphere throughout your home.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">05</div>
      <h2>Textiles & Soft Furnishings</h2>
      <p>
        Explore curtains, rugs, cushions, upholstery, bedding, and
        beautiful fabrics that add texture, comfort, and personality.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">06</div>
      <h2>Seasonal Decorating</h2>
      <p>
        Refresh your home throughout the year with seasonal arrangements,
        natural materials, flowers, and thoughtful decorative touches.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">07</div>
      <h2>Room Inspiration</h2>
      <p>
        Gather ideas for living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, dining rooms,
        bathrooms, and welcoming entrance spaces.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="decor-card">
      <div class="decor-number">08</div>
      <h2>Home Organization</h2>
      <p>
        Create calm and functional spaces with practical storage,
        thoughtful organization, and simple everyday routines.
      </p>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="decor-note">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Art of Living Well</p>
    <h2>A Home That Reflects You</h2>
    <p>
      Beautiful interiors are not simply about following trends. They are
      about creating spaces that reflect your taste, support your lifestyle,
      and bring pleasure to everyday living.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .decor-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 38px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .decor-intro h1,
  .decor-note h2 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .decor-intro h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .decor-intro > p:last-child {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .decor-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 35px 0 45px;
  }

  .decor-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 15px;
    padding: 25px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .decor-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(80, 45, 55, 0.07);
  }

  .decor-number {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .decor-card h2 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .decor-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .decor-note {
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    margin: 35px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .decor-note h2 {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .decor-note > p:last-child {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .decor-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .decor-card {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .decor-note {
      padding: 25px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
